SUMMARY:Classic Rock Fridays! Music Appreciation-The Best Rock of the 60s\
 , 70s\, and 80s
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nGood day everyone\,\n\nJoin us thi
 s Friday night at The Pheasant for a laid-back and at time upbeat evening 
 of classic rock! Grab a pint\, catch up with old friends or meet some new 
 ones\, and enjoy great rock from the ’60s\, ’70s\, and ’80s. If a fa
 vourite song gets you out of your chair\, feel free to get up and dance!\n
 ㅤ\n\n* **The ’60s** brought us the Beatles\, the Rolling Stones\, C.C.
 R.\, The Kinks\, The Animlas\, The Who\, The Jimy Hendrix Experience\, The
  Beach Boys and the Doors\, from the British Invasion to psychedelic rock.
 \n* **The ’70s** gave us Led Zeppelin\, Fleetwood Mac\, The Eagles\, Aer
 osmith\, Heart\, Queen\, Boston\, Pink Floyd\, David Bowie and Tom Petty a
 nd the Heartbreakers\, with big guitar riffs and songs you still know by h
 eart.\n* **The ’80s** brought us Bruce Springsteen\, John Mellencamp\, Z
 Z Top\, AC DC\, Journey\, Billy Idol\, Van Halen Def Leppard\, Joan Jett\,
  Pat Benatar\, Guns n' Roses The Police and Bon Jovi\, with arena anthems 
 and plenty to sing along to.\n\nㅤ\nWhether you grew up with these songs 
 or discovered them years later\, come share a favourite track\, talk about
  a concert you still remember\, or just kick back and listen. (Even dance 
 if you like)\nㅤ\n*We’ll be joined by my other social groups too\, so w
 e can look forward to a friendly crowd and good conversation!*\nㅤ\n*We
 ’ll be in the back dining area at **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub**\, 1999 
 Avenue Road\, roughly six blocks north of Lawrence Avenue and south of the
  401. When you arrive\, ask the bartender or wait staff for Steve’s even
 t.*\nㅤ\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/DJ)\nㅤ\n\n### Event 
 Details:\n\n* 🎸 A DJ mix of classic rock from the ’60s\, ’70s\, and
  ’80s\, from big guitar riffs to singalong favourites.\n* 🍻 A relaxed
  pub hangout where you can grab a pint\, swap concert stories\, and meet f
 ellow rock fans.\n* 💃 Get up and dance when a favourite comes on\, or k
 ick back at your table and enjoy the music.\n\nPlease arrive between **9:3
 0 and 10:15 p.m.**\, (if you can) You’re welcome to come earlier. Just a
 sk for Steve when you arrive.\nㅤ\n**Event Fee:**\n**$5 per person** (HST
  included). Pay cash at the door or send an e-transfer to [steveflemming11
 @gmail.com](mailto:steveflemming11@gmail.com).\n*No extra charge for those
  attending the earlier event.*\nㅤ\n**About Your Host:**\nSteve Flemming 
 has been a DJ since the early 2000s and has a lifelong passion for music\,
  especially from the 1960s through the 1990s. His father was also a DJ dur
 ing the ’70s and ’80s\, so music was a big part of Steve’s life grow
 ing up. He enjoys sharing great songs and bringing people together through
  music.\nㅤ\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\n* The Pheasant offers a dinner me
 nu and food specials.\n* To help support the venue\, please purchase at le
 ast one beverage or appetizer upon arrival.\n\nㅤ\n**Parking and Transpor
 tation:**\nThere’s street parking along Avenue Road and free parking on 
 nearby residential side streets where permitted.\nㅤ\nThe venue is approx
 imately a 15–20-minute walk from Lawrence subway station at Yonge and La
 wrence. You can also take a bus or Uber from the station.\nㅤ
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/torontotnt/events/317560386/
