SUMMARY:The Mix and Mingle Saturday Night Dinner Party with 80s and 90s Mu
 sic! 
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nGood day everyone\,\n\nJoin us for
  a relaxed and friendly Saturday night dinner party where you can meet new
  people\, catch up with familiar faces and enjoy an evening of conversatio
 n\, laughter and classic 80s and 90s music.\n\n\\*Joined by my other socia
 l groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out with lots of frien
 dly peers to begin our weekend with!\n\n\\*Please note we are at **The Phe
 asant: A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Avenue Road (roughly 6 blocks north of Lawre
 nce - south of the 401 **(we are in the back dining area to find us)**\n\n
 *\\*You can also ask the wait staff or bartender if you like to show you t
 o the group (simply ask for Steve's games event)*\n\n**-Free Parking found
  on residential side streets**\n\n(Event Details Below)\n\nSincerely\,\n\n
 DJ Steve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host )\n\nEvent Details:\n**The Mix and Ming
 le Saturday Night Dinner Party!**\n\nCome on your own or bring a friend. W
 e'll enjoy dinner together\, mingle throughout the evening and let some gr
 eat music from two unforgettable decades add to the atmosphere.\n\n• **M
 ix and mingle** with a friendly group in a relaxed social setting\n• **E
 njoy dinner and conversation** while getting to know some new people\n• 
 **Listen to great 80s and 90s music** throughout the evening\n• **Come o
 n your own or bring a friend** — everyone is welcome to join the fun\n\n
 **Event Fee: $10**\nPayment can be made **in cash at the event** or **in a
 dvance by e-transfer to [SteveFlemming11@gmail.com](mailto:SteveFlemming11
 @gmail.com)**.\nIf paying by e-transfer\, please include **your name** in 
 the message so your payment can be easily identified.\nCome hungry\, bring
  your sense of fun and join us for a Saturday night of food\, music and go
 od company!\n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\n-Arrive any time after 6:30 for 
 dinner and mingling\n\\*No extra fee for the 80s and 90s party after dinne
 r\n\n\\*Great dinner menu and food specials provided:\n(One beverage or ap
 petizer minimum upon arrival to support venue)\n\n**Parking and Transporta
 tion:**\n\\*Lots of street parking on avenue and free residential parking\
 nhttps://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/\n\n(15-20 minute walk fr
 om Yonge & Lawrence subway station-or simply take bus or uber from the sta
 tion)
