 arty! (Nov 28)
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nGood day everyone\,\n\nGet ready t
 o turn back the clock and dance the night away to some of the greatest mus
 ic of the 80s\, 90s\, early 2000s and your requests too!\n\nJoin us for a 
 energy filled Saturday night at The Pheasant filled with great music\, foo
 d/drink specials\, dancing\, laughs and a super fun crowd.\n\n\\*Joined by
  my other social groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out wit
 h lots of friendly peers to begin our weekend with!\n\n\\*Please note we a
 re at **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Avenue Road (roughly 6 blocks
  north of Lawrence - south of the 401 **(we are in the back dining area to
  find us)**\n\n*\\*You can also ask the wait staff or bartender if you lik
 e to show you to the group (simply ask for Steve's games event)*\n\n**-Fre
 e Parking found on residential side streets**\n\n(Event Details Below)\n\n
 Sincerely\,\n\nDJ Steve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host )\n\nEvent Details:\n**T
 he Ultimate 80s\, 90s and Early 2000s Saturday Night Dance and Party!**\n\
 nDJ Steve Flemming will be playing a great mix of familiar favourites from
  two unforgettable decades.\n\n• Dance to 80s and 90s favourites with so
 ngs that bring back some great memories\n• Enjoy a fun party atmosphere 
 with disco lights\, music and plenty of room to dance\n• Mix and mingle 
 with new people and familiar faces throughout the evening\n• Come on you
 r own or bring a friend — just arrive ready for a fun Saturday night!\n\
 n**Event Fee: $10**\nPayment can be made **in cash at the event** or **in 
 advance by e-transfer to [SteveFlemming11@gmail.com](mailto:SteveFlemming1
 1@gmail.com)**\nIf paying by e-transfer\, please include **your name** in 
 the message so your payment can be easily identified.\n\nCome join us\, hi
 t the dance floor and enjoy a Saturday night filled with music\, memories 
 and good company!\n\n***\n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\n-Arrive anytime bet
 ween 8:00 pm and 10:00 pm (if you can)\n(arrive earlier if you like)\n\n\\
 *Great dinner menu and food specials provided:\n(One beverage or appetizer
  minimum upon arrival to support venue)\n\n**Parking and Transportation:**
 \n\\*Lots of street parking on avenue and free residential parking\nhttps:
 //www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/\n\n(15-20 minute walk from Yong
 e & Lawrence subway station-or simply take bus or uber from the station)
