SUMMARY:🍁 Fall Walk: Scarborough Bluffs & Guildwood Gardens Adventure! 
 🌾🏞️
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\n## 🍁 **Fall Walk: Scarborough B
 luffs & Guildwood Gardens Adventure!** 🌾🏞️\n\nJoin us for a **gorg
 eous fall walk** as we explore the golden leaves\, crisp air\, and stunnin
 g views of **Guildwood Gardens** and the **Scarborough Bluffs**!\nWe’ll 
 start our adventure at **Guildwood Gardens**\, a peaceful and historic par
 k that transforms beautifully in autumn. Once home to Toronto’s creative
  elite\, this garden is filled with sculptures\, architectural relics\, an
 d winding pathways framed by fiery fall foliage. It’s like stepping into
  a living art gallery — only with more squirrels and crunchy leaves. 
 🍂🎨\nFrom there\, we’ll make our way to the **Scarborough Bluffs**\
 , one of the city’s most breathtaking natural wonders.\n\nThe bluffs str
 etch for 15 km along Lake Ontario\, and in the fall\, the contrast between
  the turquoise water and the amber trees is *chef’s kiss*. We’ll walk 
 the scenic waterfront trail\, breathe in the fresh air\, and enjoy some of
  the best autumn views Toronto has to offer. 🍁🌊\n\nThis is one of ou
 r most **photogenic fall walks** — so bring your camera (and your cozy f
 lannel)!\n\n***\n\n### 📍 **Meetup Details**\n\n**Meeting Spot:** Inside
  **Kennedy Station** by *Gateway on the Go* (on the Bus Platform).\nLook f
 or me wearing my **famous Moose Hat!** 🦌\n**🕚 Meetup Time:** **10:15
  A.M. sharp!**\nI’ll wait about 5 minutes — *Early is on time. On time
  is late!*\n\n**🚌 Bus:** We’ll take the **116 Morningside Bus** to Gu
 ild Park & Gardens.\nThe bus leaves at **10:30 A.M.** — don’t miss it\
 , or you’ll have to catch up on your own!\n\n**🚗 Driving:**\nFree par
 king is available at the **Guild Inn Estate**.\nWe’ll meet drivers aroun
 d **11:00 A.M.** near the bus stop in front of the Guild Inn by the road.\
 nPlease let me know if you’re driving — note that you’ll have to wal
 k a little to get back to your car after the hike.\n\n***\n\n### 💲 **Me
 etup Fee**\n\n$5 (cash 💵 or e-transfer 📲 to **mathewmaclean@hotmail.
 com**)\nYou can send it before or on the day of the event!\n\n***\n\n### 
 🥾 **What to Bring**\n\n* Water 💧\n* Good walking/hiking shoes 👟\n
 * A snack or light lunch 🍎\n* A cozy sweater or jacket — it *will* be
  breezy by the lake! 🧣\n* Camera or phone for those perfect fall photos
  🍁📸\n\n***\n\n### ⚠️ **A Quick Note**\n\nSometimes life happens 
 and I might need to cancel or reschedule — please keep an eye on the eve
 nt page for updates.\n\n***\n\n### 👋 **About This Group**\n\nThis group
  is open to **everyone** — whether you’re single\, social\, new to the
  city\, or just want to get out and enjoy the fall colours!\nWe also host 
 **movies\, hikes\, arts & culture events\, and restaurant outings.**\n\nYo
 u can RSVP in advance — or just show up if you’re feeling spontaneous!
 \n\n***\n\n**Organizer:** Mathew\n📧 **torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.c
 om**\n\n**Come for the water.** 🐦 **Stay for the view.**\n**Leave with 
 a new connection — and maybe a new friend.** 🍂💛
