SUMMARY:Love Will Find a Way! (Group Dating Game)
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\nPlease join us
  for a fun\, interactive and laughter filled "group dating game" experienc
 e. We all bring years of knowledge\, wisdom and stories\; so together we c
 an support\, inspire and share optimal understanding to love\, dating and 
 fulfilling relationships.\n\nThis will be a well organized\, interactive a
 nd valuable afternoon as we dive deeper into the real meanings of love\, r
 omance\, intimacy and effective dating.\n\nWe will be joined by my other s
 ocial groups too so we can anticipate a great afternoon\n\nEvent details b
 elow:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n━━━━━
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nEve
 nt Details\nSteve Flemming Presents:\n**Love Will Find a Way!**\n**(Group 
 Dating Game)**\n\n* An inspiring\, interactive and welcoming afternoon as 
 we go deeper into the universal topic of love\, dating and intimate relati
 onships\n* Let's not take ourselves too seriously either (we're all in thi
 s together—so we'll definitely share some laughs too :)\n* Invite your f
 riends or come on your own\; all are welcome!\n* Stick around after for ou
 r dinner party event too (optional—no extra fee to join that event)\n\n
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 ━━━━\nAbout the Organizer/Host\nSteve Flemming provides over 20 ye
 ars of producing community events and group facilitation on personal growt
 h\, spirituality and relationships. He looks forward to involving everyone
  in a safe\, fun and inspirational way. We will be sure to experience a wo
 nderful afternoon with great\, thoughtful people in an ideal setting for c
 onnection and conversation.\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n**Where to Meet Us**\nDate: Sunda
 y\, November 29th\, 2026\nTime: 2:00 pm\nLocation: The Pheasant — A Firk
 in Pub\nAddress: 1999 Avenue Road\, Toronto\nMeeting area: Back dining are
 a\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 ━━━━━\n**Event Fee and Payment**\nEvent fee: $10 upon arrival\, 
 HST included\nPayment: Cash or e-transfer when you arrive\nE-transfer: [st
 eveflemming11@gmail.com](mailto:steveflemming11@gmail.com)\nParking: Free 
 parking in the residential area around the venue\n━━━━━━━━
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nFood and Bev
 erages\n\n* Dinner and beverage menu available too\n* Includes reserved se
 ating for the group\n* Beverage and/or appetizer minimum to support the st
 aff and venue\n\nRemember to tip the hard-working servers too. Thank you f
 or your co-operation :)
