SUMMARY:Meaningful Conversations and Cocktails!
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\nJoin us for **
 Meaningful Conversations and Cocktails!** — a relaxed and friendly Sunda
 y evening filled with interesting discussions\, laughter and great company
 !\n\nWe'll explore a variety of topics\, including relationships\, friends
 hips\, travel\, music\, movies\, personal experiences\, work-life balance\
 , psychology\, spirituality\, philosophy\, the future\, human nature and w
 hatever else sparks our curiosity. We'll keep things lighthearted and stee
 r clear of political debates!\n\nWhether you're outgoing or a little reser
 ved\, everyone is welcome to share their thoughts\, exchange ideas and enj
 oy some refreshing drinks in a comfortable\, welcoming atmosphere.\n\nDate
 : Sunday\, November 29\, 2026\nArrival Time: 5:00 PM\nLocation: The Pheasa
 nt: A Firkin Pub\nAddress: 1999 Avenue Road\, Toronto\nMeeting Area: Back 
 dining area\n\nJoined by my other social groups too :)\nLooking forward to
  a wonderful evening of conversation and new connections!\n\nSincerely\,\n
 \nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n━━━━━━━━━━━━
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nEvent Details\n**Event: 
 Meaningful Conversations and Cocktails!**\n\n• Enjoy meaningful conversa
 tions on a variety of interesting and relatable topics\n• Meet friendly 
 people\, exchange ideas and make new connections\n• Relax over cocktails
 \, refreshments and delicious food in a welcoming pub atmosphere\n• Enjo
 y a casual\, pressure-free evening filled with laughter\, friendship and g
 reat company\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 ━━━━━━━━\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n**Event Fee & Payment:*
 *\n$5 per person\nE-transfer in advance to: [steveflemming11@gmail.com](ma
 ilto:stevefleming11@gmail.com)\nOr pay cash at the door\n━━━━━
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nFoo
 d & Drinks\nMinimum purchase: One beverage or appetizer per person.\nFood 
 and drink specials available!\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nParking\nFree residential stre
 et parking nearby
