SUMMARY:🌸✨ Fleurs de Villes JOYEUX: The Must-See Holiday Floral Trail
 ! ✨🌸
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\n# 🎁 Toronto’s Most Instagramm
 able Holiday Walk Returns!\n\n🌸✨ **Fleurs de Villes JOYEUX – A Holi
 day Floral Trail!** ✨🌸\n\nCome out and enjoy a beautiful Thursday eve
 ning in Bloor–Yorkville! **Fleurs de Villes JOYEUX** transforms the neig
 hbourhood into an open-air gallery filled with fresh flowers and spectacul
 ar festive floral creations.\n\nDiscover more than 30 unique installations
 \, handcrafted by talented Toronto florists using fresh blooms. From life-
 sized floral sculptures to whimsical holiday designs\, these creations are
  a feast for the eyes and make for some wonderful photo opportunities. 
 📸\n\nGrab your camera\, bundle up\, and join us for an evening stroll t
 hrough one of Toronto's most beautiful neighbourhoods. It's a chance to en
 joy the flowers\, take in the holiday atmosphere\, and spend a little time
  together!\n\n***\n\n## 🌹 Meetup Details\n\n📍 **Meeting Location:** 
 Outside the Toronto Reference Library (Bloor & Yonge)\n👒 Look for Mathe
 w wearing his famous Moose Hat!\n🕡 **Meeting Time:** 6:30 PM sharp\nMat
 hew will wait a maximum of 5 minutes before the group departs.\n🏁 **End
  Point:** Yonge & Bloor\n💲 **Group Support Fee: $5 IN CASH or E-transfe
 r**\n📲 **E-transfer:** [mathewmaclean@hotmail.com](mailto:mathewmaclean
 @hotmail.com)\n\nThe fee applies to everyone\, regardless of how long you'
 ve been a member. There are no exceptions or refunds. Your contribution he
 lps support the group and keep our activities going. Thank you!\n\n***\n\n
 ## 👟 What to Bring\n\n* Comfortable walking shoes 👣\n* Water 💧\n*
  Your phone or camera for photos 📸\n* Weather-appropriate clothing 🧣
 \n\nRemember\, there's no such thing as bad weather\, only bad clothing!\n
 \n***\n\n## 🥂 Come for the Flowers\, Stay for the Christmas Cheer!\n\nA
 fter exploring Toronto's beautiful holiday floral trail\, we'll head over 
 to **Jack Astor's**\, which gets into the Christmas spirit with its festiv
 e holiday bar decorations! 🎄🍹\nCome for the flowers\, stay for the C
 hristmas atmosphere\, good food\, drinks\, and great company!\n\nWe'll fin
 ish the evening together with a little holiday cheer. Participation after 
 the walk is optional\, and members are responsible for their own food and 
 drinks.\n\n⚠️ **Event Updates:** Occasionally\, circumstances may requ
 ire an event to be rescheduled or changed. Please check the event page for
  updates before heading out.\n\n***\n\n**Organizer:** Mathew\nQuestions? P
 ost on the event wall or email [torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com](mailt
 o:torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com)
